  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Serbia National programme IPA TAIB 2013 (Decentralised part)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This part covers interventions that will be manged under decentralised management. The priorities of the IPA 2013 National Programme for Serbia are in line with those of the Multi-annual Indicative Planning Document (MIPD): 1) Strenghten the rule of law and public administration; 2) Overcome the economic crisis and improve copetitiveness and 3) Support social inclusion and reconciliation.</narrative>
  </description>
